<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="container">
    <h1>BSAA CORRUPTION TIMELINE</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--terminal-white); margin-bottom: 2rem;">USE OF B.O.W.S // INVESTIGATION // CLASSIFIED</p>
    
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/timeline" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'INCIDENT TIMELINE' ? 'active' : '' %>">MAIN TIMELINE</a>
        <a href="/timeline/bsaa-corruption" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'BSAA CORRUPTION TIMELINE' ? 'active' : '' %>">BSAA CORRUPTION</a>
        <a href="/timeline/wesker-legacy" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'WESKER LEGACY TIMELINE' ? 'active' : '' %>">WESKER LEGACY</a>
        <a href="/timeline/umbrella" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'UMBRELLA RISE & FALL' ? 'active' : '' %>">UMBRELLA RISE & FALL</a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2003 // BSAA FOUNDED</div>
            <p>Founded to combat bioterrorism. Original goal: eliminate B.O.W. usage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2009 // POST-WESKER</div>
            <p>BSAA expands globally. Chris Redfield expresses concerns about direction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2013 // PIERS' DEATH</div>
            <p>Chris loses partner Piers Nivans. BSAA leadership questioned.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2017-2021 // SECRET OPERATIONS</div>
            <p>BSAA begins using B.O.W. soldiers in secret. Chris leaves the organization.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2021 // VILLAGE INCIDENT</div>
            <p>Chris confronts BSAA soldiers - reveals they are B.O.W. constructs.</p>
            <span class="threat-level CRITICAL">CORRUPTION CONFIRMED</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2023 // ONGOING INVESTIGATION</div>
            <p>Chris and Jill leading investigation into BSAA leadership. Classified.</p>
            <span class="threat-level ACTIVE">ACTIVE</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>